1012
00:53:02,710 --> 00:53:05,550
And remember, improving your English is a journey.

1013
00:53:05,550 --> 00:53:09,150
The more you listen and practice, the more confident you'll become.

1014
00:53:09,150 --> 00:53:10,790
Thanks again for joining us.

1015
00:53:10,790 --> 00:53:12,590
We'll see you in the next episode.

1016
00:53:12,590 --> 00:53:13,590
Take care, everyone.

1017
00:53:13,590 --> 00:53:14,090
Goodbye.
